OpenDuet patch for CopilotKit/OpenBot agent-computer (MIT) at da9a3caf5784074baa779110dd7e9d1338c8871b.
Chromium's popup blocker back on (Playwright's --disable-popup-blocking added to ignoreDefaultArgs): a window opens from a real click, not from a page's own script, so pages cannot open tabs past the app's cap.
Applied in /app by computer/Dockerfile: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0. Regenerated with diff -ruN.

